Delete NRPLMNSET_SA_1 Cell into SCF If Exist
   [Documentation]    delete NRPLMNSET_SA-1 object if present
   [Arguments]        ${scf_file_path}     ${CellId}=2       ${nodeType}=Classical
    log to console    Remove NRPLMNSET_SA-1 from SCF if present for CellId=${CellId}
    scf.Load scf    ${scf_file_path}
