#  Keyword with embedded arguments
Set Specifc Scf Param actIncreasedFdmUsersPerSlot with "${actIncreasedFdmUsersPerSlot}" value and update into "${testParam}"
#     [Arguments]          ${actIncreasedFdmUsersPerSlot}=False
    [documentation]      to set actIncreasedFdmUsersPerSlot
    ...    | Input Parameters | Man. | Description |
    ...    | actIncreasedFdmUsersPerSlot | Yes | true or false |
    ...    Example:
    ...    | Set Specifc Scf Param actIncreasedFdmUsersPerSlot with "false" value |

    ${dist}=   Catenate   MRBTS-${MRBTS_ID}/NRBTS-${NRBTS_ID}/NRCELL-1
    &{modify_param}    Create Dictionary
    ...    parameter=actIncreasedFdmUsersPerSlot
    ...    dist_name=${dist}
    ...    value=${actIncreasedFdmUsersPerSlot}
    @{modify_param}    Create List    ${modify_param}
    BuiltIn.Log      \nParameters to modify:\n @{modify_param}   console=yes
    OAM Set Params      modify_param=@{modify_param}
    Update actIncreasedFdmUsersPerSlot with "${actIncreasedFdmUsersPerSlot}" into "${testParam}"
    Dated log       actIncreasedFdmUsersPerSlot=${testParam.scfFile.nrcell.actIncreasedFdmUsersPerSlot} into TestParam updated
    # SCF.xml is used by procedure verifyFeatureActivation
    ${test_scf_file}             OAM Get SCF File            dir=${testCaseDir}      file=SCF.xml
    Set Suite Variable              ${test_scf_file}
    Dated Log                  Current SCF file stored to ${test_scf_file}

